Right now I'm trying to collect the whole corpus of lojban prose and
translations in one place.
We have http://www.lojban.org/texts/translations/drbible/

There used to be a CVS server, right? Where is it now?

Where are you planning to translate and publish the bible? In github, in
the wiki?


